Game UI => Game UI / 界面设置


GameUI => GameUI / 游戏界面设置

Visble => Visble / 显示设置
hideHud => Hide hud / 隐藏UI
showComboNum => Combo sprite appearance / 显示连击数字
showRating => Rating sprite appearance / 显示评级贴图
opponentStrums => Shows opponent strums on screen / 显示对手箭头
judgementCounter => Show your judgements / 显示判定计数板
keyboardViewer => Feedback the key you pressed / 显示键盘反馈


TimeBar => TimeBar / 时长条

timeBarType => Display type / 显示类型


HealthBar => HealthBar / 生命条

healthBarAlpha => Alpha / 透明度
oldHealthBarVersion => Reduced version to psych 0.63h / 使用psych 0.63h的血条以修复旧模组
Combo => Combo / 连击设置
comboColor => Allow to get and use rating color / 允许贴图获取和使用评级颜色
comboOffsetFix => Fix position offset / 偏移修复


KeyBoard => KeyBoard / 键盘反馈

keyboardTimeDisplay => support display press details / 显示摁压的时间细节
keyboardAlpha => Alpha / 透明度
keyboardTime => press sustain display time / 滞留时长
keyboardBGColor => keyboardBGColor / 背景颜色
keyboardTextColor => keyboardTextColor / 文字颜色


Camera => Camera / 摄像机

camZooms => Toggle the camera zoom in-game / 摄像机根据音乐节奏进行Beat
scoreZoom => Score beat when you hit note / 击打箭头会使分数栏Beat


pauseButton => Add pauseButton in game / 在游玩时左上角添加暂停按钮

compulsionPause => You can force open pause menu / 你可以强制打开暂停菜单
compulsionPauseNumber => How many times to press the button to force a pause / 按多少次暂停键强行打开暂停菜单
